{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o018b","title":"甄氏劝家赈谷亲族邻里","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o018b-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"甄氏劝家赈谷亲族邻里","evidence":["houfei-e-o018b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0016","role":"劝赈","evidence":["houfei-e-o018b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年十余岁","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-o018b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o018b-q","source_order":[5,75,"O018b"],"order":1372}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0016","name":"甄氏","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o018b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-59dd9a8a483f4ef4abdd","layer":"original","quote":"后三岁失父。﹝一﹞后天下兵乱，加以饥馑，百姓皆卖金银珠玉宝物。时，后家大有储谷，颇以买之。后年十余岁，白母曰：“今世乱而多买宝物，‘匹夫无罪，怀璧为罪’〖5〗，又左右皆饥乏；不如以谷赈给亲族邻里，广为恩惠也。”举家称善，即从后言。﹝二﹞建安中，袁绍为中子熙纳之。熙出为幽州〖6〗，后留养姑〖7〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
